These are the minutes for the October 12th, 2026 SPI Board Meeting,
held at 20:00 UTC in #spi on irc.spi-inc.org.
[LOG](../../../logs/2026/2026-10-12.txt).

## President's report
<pre>
Martin, Héctor and I have been working with our auditor to get our 2025
financial statements audited. We are also working with the auditing firm
on filing our New York State and Federal annual filings. We have received
a 6 month extension for the time to file and are confident the filings will
be completed by the November 15, 2026 deadline.

Jonatas, Hector and I have had meetings with potential new associated
projects and are meeting with a potential corporate sponsor next week.
</pre>

## Treasurer's report

<pre>
Updates & Activities:

* Payment Processing: Followed up with pending transactions and cleared the
* payment queue for all previously reviewed requests.  Audit Preparation:
* Assembled and provided requested financial documentation and materials for
* the auditors.  Grants & Funding:
  - Investigated and followed up with grantmakers regarding pending funds and
    compliance details.
  - Scheduled an upcoming meeting with another grantmaker to discuss potential
    funding opportunities.
* Conferences & Events:
  - Continued discussions and coordination with upcoming conference sponsors.
  - Worked on arrangements for the face-to-face (F2F) meeting, including venue
    discussions and hotel logistics.
* Associated Projects: Investigated onboarding requirements and met with a new
* associated project lead.  Financial Reporting: Work is currently in progress
* to update and publish outstanding Treasurer reports, with completion targeted
* for this month.

If you have any urgency, please reach out.  Thanks very much for the continuous
work of the treasurer team, including president, vice-president and
contractors.
</pre>

## Secretary's report

<pre>
I am continuing my training with Jeremy's oversight

Thank you Jeremy for ensuring that the September 2026 board meeting minutes
were posted to the website.
</pre>

