## Items up for discussion

There were none.

## Other business

* The board briefly discussed Lisbon venue logistics, and there was also a
  quick reminder about protocol for recognizing meeting guests to speak at
  meetings other than the AGM.

## Adjournment

The meeting was adjourned until Monday November 16th, 2026 at 10:00 UTC
at the Técnico Universidade de Lisboa, Portugal.

